# Optional locally — defaults to "/api", which the Vite dev server proxies to
# the backend's PORT (see vite.config.js). On Vercel, set this in the
# project's env vars to your deployed backend's full origin, no trailing
# slash and no "/api" suffix — e.g. https://codegrade-api.onrender.com
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
